# case: data tag and inventory
step 1: gomcplayer Steve 0 4 0
  count: 1
  feedback: Successfully created the player Steve
step 2: scoreboard objectives add kills dummy
  count: 1
  feedback: Added new objective 'kills' successfully
step 3: give Steve minecraft:stone 1
  count: 1
  feedback: Given [Stone] * 1 to Steve
step 4: give Steve minecraft:dirt 1
  count: 1
  feedback: Given [Dirt] * 1 to Steve
step 5: scoreboard players set Steve kills 1 {Inventory:[{id:"minecraft:stone",Count:1b}]}
  count: 1
  feedback: Set score of kills for player Steve to 1
step 6: scoreboard players set Steve kills 2 {Inventory:[{id:"minecraft:gold",Count:1b}]}
  error: The dataTag does not match for Steve
step 7: scoreboard players set Steve kills 3 {Inventory:[{id:"minecraft:stone",Count:1b},{id:"minecraft:dirt",Count:1b}]}
  count: 1
